ss-15j76c0"><div class="MuiStack-root css-15xezpt"><a class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-containedPrimary MuiButton-sizeLarge MuiButton-containedSizeLarge MuiButton-colorPrimary MuiButton-disableElevation MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-containedPrimary MuiButton-sizeLarge MuiButton-containedSizeLarge MuiButton-colorPrimary MuiButton-disableElevation css-c9uiqo" tabindex="0" href="/search?byPublicType=ResearchDataSet">Περισσότερα<span class="MuiButton-icon MuiButton-endIcon MuiButton-iconSizeLarge css-1ab87kf"><span></span></span></a><a class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-containedInfo MuiButton-sizeLarge MuiButton-containedSizeLarge MuiButton-colorInfo MuiButton-disableElevation MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-containedInfo MuiButton-sizeLarge MuiButton-containedSizeLarge MuiButton-colorInfo MuiButton-disableElevation css-1tvusda" tabindex="0" href="/stats/research">Στατιστικά<span class="MuiButton-icon MuiButton-endIcon MuiButton-iconSizeLarge css-1ab87kf"><span></span></span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-index="2" class="slick-slide" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" style="outline:none;width:9.090909090909092%;position:relative;left:-18px;opacity:0;z-index:998;transition:opacity 5ms ease, visibility 5ms ease"><div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container css-1yzw1fn"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-item MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 css-15j76c0"><div class="MuiBox-root css-osvbvy"><div sx="[object Object]" class="css-1glj0nh"><span></span></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-zew3wd"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 css-1lgai4f">Κατάθεση Διδακτορικών Διατριβών</h3></div></div></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-item MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 css-15j76c0"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-zkjnki">Η &quot;Πέργαμος&quot; προσφέρει κεντρική ηλεκτρονική διαδικασία κατάθεσης τόσο της βιβλιογραφικής εγγραφής, όσο και του πλήρους κειμένου των διατριβών των νέων διδακτόρων του Πανεπιστημίου. Η διαδικασία είναι διαθέσιμη για τους διαπιστευμένους υποψήφιους διδάκτορες του Πανεπιστημίου και υποστηρίζει την αυτόματη απόδοση DOI στη σχετική εγγραφή καθώς και τον καθορισμό περιόδων αποκλεισμού πρόσβασης - &quot;embargo&quot;.</p></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-item MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 css-15j76c0"><div class="MuiStack-root css-11wy8vn"><div class="MuiStack-root css-zwd3xv"><h2 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 css-10n7s6t">6.552</h2><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-ixfdhs">διδακτορικές διατριβές</p></div></div></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-item MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 css-15j76c0"><div class="MuiStack-root css-15xezpt"><a class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-containedPrimary MuiButton-sizeLarge MuiButton-containedSizeLarge MuiButton-colorPrimary MuiButton-disableElevation MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-containedPrimary MuiButton-sizeLarge MuiButton-containedSizeLarge MuiButton-colorPrimary MuiButton-disableElevation css-c9uiqo" tabindex="0" href="/search?byPublicType=BornDigitalThesis">Περισσότερα<span class="MuiButton-icon MuiButton-endIcon MuiButton-iconSizeLarge css-1ab87kf"><span></span></span></a><a class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-containedInfo MuiButton-sizeLarge MuiButton-containedSizeLarge MuiButton-colorInfo MuiButton-disableElevation MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-containedInfo MuiButton-sizeLarge MuiButton-containedSizeLarge MuiButton-colorInfo MuiButton-disableElevation css-1tvusda" tabindex="0" href="/stats/gray-literature">Στατιστικά<span class="MuiButton-icon MuiButton-endIcon MuiButton-iconSizeLarge css-1ab87kf"><span></span></span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-index="3" class="slick-slide" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" style="outline:none;width:9.090909090909092%;position:relative;left:-27px;opacity:0;z-index:998;transition:opacity 5ms ease, visibility 5ms ease"><div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container css-1yzw1fn"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-item MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 css-15j76c0"><div class="MuiBox-root css-osvbvy"><div sx="[object Object]" class="css-1glj0nh"><span></span></div><div class="MuiBox-root css-zew3wd"><h3 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 css-1lgai4f">Κατάθεση Πτυχιακών &amp; Διπλωματικών Εργασιών (γκρίζα βιβλιογραφία)</h3></div></div></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-item MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 css-15j76c0"><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-zkjnki">Η &quot;Πέργαμος&quot; παρέχει κεντρική, ενοποιημένη και ομοιόμορφη ηλεκτρονική διαδικασία κατάθεσης πτυχιακών &amp; διπλωματικών εργασιών για το σύνολο των Βιβλιοθηκών του Πανεπιστημίου. Η υπηρεσία είναι διαθέσιμη για όλους τους διαπιστευμένους φοιτητές του Πανεπιστημίου.</p></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-item MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 css-15j76c0"><div class="MuiStack-root css-11wy8vn"><div class="MuiStack-root css-zwd3xv"><h2 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 css-10n7s6t">46.806</h2><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-ixfdhs">εργασίες</p></div></div></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-item MuiGrid-grid-xs-12 css-15j76c0"><div class="MuiStack-root css-15xezpt"><a class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-containedPrimary MuiButton-sizeLarge MuiButton-containedSizeLarge MuiButton-colorPrimary MuiButton-disableElevation MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-containedPrimary MuiButton-sizeLarge MuiButton-containedSizeLarge MuiButton-colorPrimary MuiButton-disableElevation css-c9uiqo" tabindex="0" href="/search?byPublicType=BornDigitalGraduateThesis&amp;byPublicType=BornDigitalPostgraduateThesis">Περισσότερα<span class="MuiButton-icon MuiButton-endIcon MuiButton-iconSizeLarge css-1ab87kf"><span></span></span></a><a class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-containedInfo MuiButton-sizeLarge MuiButton-containedSizeLa